ory advisory body established under the aegis of the University Grants Committee (UGC). For details of its terms of reference, please visit the homepage of the Council at http://www.ugc.edu.hk/eng/rgc/.\nAbout CityUHK\nIntroduction\nWhy CityUHK\nStudents and Alumni Sharing\nFacilities & Supports\nResearch Degree Programmes\nIntroduction\nResearch Areas\nEntrance Requirements\nSteps & Procedures\nScholarships, Financial Aid & Fees\nHK PhD Fellowship Scheme\nApply Now\nProfessional Doctorate Programmes\nIntroduction\nProgramme List\nSteps & Procedures\nApply Now\nMaster's Programmes\nIntroduction\nProgramme List\nEntrance Requirements\nSteps & Procedures\nFAQs\nApply Now\nHong Kong Future Talents Scholarship Scheme for Advanced Studies (FTSS)\nLatest Updates\nVisiting\nVisiting Research Students\nVisiting Postgraduate Students\nApply Now\nResearch Degree Programmes\nProfessional Doctorate Programmes\nMaster's Programmes\nNews and Events\nInformation Session\nCityUHK NewsCentre\nContact Us\nPrivacy Policy\nCopyright\nDisclaimer\nAccessibility\n\u00a9 2026 City University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved.\nWe use cookies to ensure you get the best experience on our website.\nMore Information\nConfirm\nSGS Postgraduate Chatbot", "links": [["", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk"], ["Postgraduate Admissions \u7814\u7a76\u751f\u8ab2\u7a0b\u62db\u751f", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/en/pg"], ["Home", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/en/pg"], ["About CityUHK", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/en/pg"], ["Overview", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/en/pg"], ["Introduction", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/en/pg"], ["Why CityUHK", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/about/cityu-at-a-glance"], ["Students and Alumni Sharing", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/aro/alumnistories/index.htm"], ["Facilities & Supports", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/en/pg/about-cityuhk/facilities-and-supports"], ["Research Degree Programmes", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/en/pg/research-degree-programmes/introduction"], ["Overview", "https://www.cityu.edu.hk/en/pg/